WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.222
SPEAKER 1: Hey, everyone.

00:00:01.222 --> 00:00:02.640
Today is day one of KubeCon.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.770
KubeCon is the biggest
Kubernetes conference

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.610
in the world.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.189
We're here in sunny
San Diego, California,

00:00:08.189 --> 00:00:09.840
at the Google Cloud booth.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.790
We have a ton of
activities here.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.920
Come join us and
play the Cloud City

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.290
game, where you could
be mayor for a day

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.270
and help modernize apps.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.400
We even have LEGOs behind me.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.570
Join us if you're here.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.400
If not, subscribe
to the GCP channel.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.640
We're going to bring
you content all week.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.130
We have influencers who
are going to be telling us

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.630
about what they're
working on, we're

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.549
going to hear recaps
from folks who are giving

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:34.260
talks, and much, much more.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.770
Stay tuned and subscribe.

